    <item>
      <title>Free Autobuild (TotK 1.4.3)</title>
      <author>KonoMelioDa</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/735496</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/735496#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b7b0ca4cb072a3f4a4ee7319f5a021c88059ae29</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:22:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae87e44d3c14.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae87dd7d26c3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Free Autobuild&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
Autobuild &lt;b&gt;no longer costs any Zonaite&lt;/b&gt;. Build your saved schematics anywhere, as often as you want.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Compatibility&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
This mod was made and tested on &lt;b&gt;totk-pc-recomp&lt;/b&gt; (TotK 1.4.3). It has &lt;b&gt;not been tested on emulators or on a modded Switch&lt;/b&gt;, but as a standard RomFS mod it should work there too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Emulator / modded Switch:&lt;/b&gt; install it with &lt;b&gt;TKMM&lt;/b&gt; (TotK Mod Manager). TKMM merges it with other mods that edit the same files (including mods that add new items) and handles the RESTBL automatically.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;totk-pc-recomp:&lt;/b&gt; mods are loaded as folders without merging, so this mod replaces &lt;code&gt;RSDB/GameActorInfo&lt;/code&gt;. Place &lt;b&gt;Free Autobuild at the top&lt;/b&gt; of your mod list.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Already includes compatibility data for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dominus Aquae (TotK 1.4.3 port)&lt;/b&gt; (coming soon)&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/641335"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shinobi no Satori&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; by Catzy123&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
You don't need these mods: if they are not installed, this data is simply ignored.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
If you try it on an emulator or a Switch, feel free to tell me in the comments whether it works!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom (tested on &lt;b&gt;1.4.3&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Any setup that loads RomFS mods (TKMM for emulator / modded Switch, or totk-pc-recomp)&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/free_autobuild_totk_143__89e2a.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Gameplay</category>
      <category>Gameplay</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Awakened Sages (TotK 1.4.3)</title>
      <author>KonoMelioDa</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/735490</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/735490#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">0cd37436393a6049824f5a611b954fd4de512381</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:54:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae8783279a0a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae877dcd52d7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae8782b92abb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Awakened Sages&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
Makes your Sage companions stronger, faster and more useful.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;For all Sages&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;No cooldown on their abilities&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Faster attacks, more damage, longer range&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Normal appearance (no blue spirit look)&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Their voices and footstep sounds&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Tulin&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
His gust of wind is &lt;b&gt;stronger&lt;/b&gt;: it pushes Link further when gliding and gives arrows a bigger boost. Usable again right away.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Sidon&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
His water shield can be used &lt;b&gt;again right away&lt;/b&gt;, without waiting for the cooldown.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Riju&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
Her lightning area &lt;b&gt;no longer needs to charge&lt;/b&gt;: it is at its &lt;b&gt;maximum size as soon as you activate it&lt;/b&gt;. Usable again right away.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Yunobo&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
His charge hits walls at a &lt;b&gt;90° angle&lt;/b&gt;, so he bounces straight off them instead of rolling away. Usable again right away.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;About the screenshots&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
The screenshots only show &lt;b&gt;Tulin&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;Riju&lt;/b&gt;, because my save does not have the other two Sages yet. &lt;b&gt;Sidon&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;Yunobo&lt;/b&gt; are included and work just as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Known limitations&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Tulin's skill sound is not muted (the sound files changed in 1.4).&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom &lt;b&gt;1.4.3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Any setup that loads RomFS mods (emulator, modded console, totk-pc-recomp...)&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Inspired by &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/443839"&gt;Better Sages Mod&lt;/a&gt; by ShrineFox and &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/445290"&gt;Yet Another Better Sages Mod&lt;/a&gt; by Moonling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;i&gt;Tested on totk-pc-recomp.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/awakened_sages_totk_143__5424c.zip" type="application/zip"/>
