      <category>Gameplay</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Link Rapid Bows x5 (TotK 1.4.3)</title>
      <author>KonoMelioDa</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/735487</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/735487#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">e7d82a6d832b4f2f6b7f91f9b7e911510f7a8818</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:24:31 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae872ea4a8e6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae872c60f271.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Link Rapid Bows x5&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
These bows now fire &lt;b&gt;5 arrows in a quick burst&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Forest Dweller's Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Zora Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Swallow Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Great Eagle Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Phrenic Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Royal Guard's Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Wooden Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Dusk Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Zonaite Bow&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
Only bows that &lt;b&gt;no enemy carries&lt;/b&gt; were changed, so enemies still shoot normally. Bows added by other mods are not affected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Work in progress&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
I am currently working on a version that brings the burst to &lt;b&gt;all bows&lt;/b&gt;, for Link only, without affecting enemies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
