    <item>
      <title>Wise Old Man (Cheat NPC)</title>
      <author>Deano309</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/715016</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/715016#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4295ed602e35c4957fd80749e343cc1107e357c5</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 10:44:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f56d6978b0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f56fc3e48f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f57097580c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaa0b94b32f3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeafe71d5f0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Updates&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Autocomplete GSI (All abilities &amp; requirements for completing GSI get completed - ONLY available at start of NG)&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Toggle Triple-Jump (Useful for bullet-time, or to get some extra height for reaching higher places)&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Toggle Air-Jump (Jump and then repeatedly press "A" to keep jumping whilst in the air)&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In Hyrule, there is an Old Man who can change the rules of the world around you!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Originally outside the Room of Awakening, he has also been spotted atop Eventide Island.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nobody knows where he came from, or why he is there, but he has options for the following:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Durability:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Ambient Durability Restore &lt;i&gt;(All Weapons/Shields/Bows)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; [Items must be stowed in pouch for them to regenerate]&lt;br&gt;- Trigger &lt;i&gt;Timed&lt;/i&gt; Infinite WEAPON durability&lt;i&gt; (All weapons)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; [Shrine doors can't be interacted with while the timer is active]&lt;br&gt;- Fully restore &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;equipped&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/u&gt; PRISTINE Weapon/Shield/Bow durability &lt;i&gt;(ONLY for vanilla game items)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Other:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Health &lt;i&gt;(40 Hearts)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Stamina&lt;i&gt; (3 Wheels)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Battery &lt;i&gt;(16 batteries/48 cells)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Slots - &lt;i&gt;Weapon (20)/Bow (14)/Shield (20)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Stats of All Registered Horses&lt;br&gt;- Change Master Sword Cooldown Timer&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Master Sword Usable Recharge&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Master Sword Awakened State&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Instant Sage Skills&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Free Autobuild&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Ambient Healing&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Hylian Metabolism &lt;i&gt;(Survival Style)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Infinite Health &lt;i&gt;(Can still drown or burn in Lava)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Infinite Stamina&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Infinite Battery&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Fire/Freeze/Shock Proof&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Gloom Protection&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Fast Travel &lt;i&gt;(Warp)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Phantom Mode&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Gloom &lt;i&gt;(Mostly)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Depths Illumination&lt;br&gt;- Trigger Bloodmoon&lt;br&gt;- Autocomplete GSI&lt;br&gt;- Mark game as Demon King Ganondorf defeated&lt;br&gt;- +1 Free random max level/30 min meal per day &lt;i&gt;(Made from recipes containing dragon parts)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Movement:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Triple Jump&lt;br&gt;- Air Jump&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inventory &amp;amp; Key Items:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Arrows&lt;br&gt;- Max Rupees&lt;br&gt;- 250K Poes&lt;br&gt;- 250K Zonaite Ore&lt;br&gt;- 250K Crystallized Charges&lt;br&gt;- Gem Bundle&lt;i&gt; (50 Diamond/Ruby/Sapphire/Topaz/Opal)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Dragon Horn Bundle &lt;i&gt;(50 of each)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fairy pack&lt;i&gt; (50)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Zonai Devices Bundle&lt;i&gt; (50 of each)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Set All Buff Meals in pouch to last 1 hour&lt;br&gt;- Set All Materials in pouch to 888 of each&lt;br&gt;- Set All Zonai Devices in pouch to 888 of each&lt;br&gt;- Set All Meals in pouch to 888 of each&lt;br&gt;- 152 Blessings&lt;br&gt;- 147 Bubbul Gems&lt;br&gt;- 20 Sage's Will&lt;br&gt;- 3 Warp Points&lt;br&gt;- Schema Stones (12)&lt;br&gt;- Yiga Schematics (34)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Weapon Shop:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(Exchangeable items only show once you have collected at least 1 of them)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Exchange Decayed for Pristine&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show Map Locations:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt; (Once shown, they cannot be hidden again)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Shrines&lt;br&gt;- Lightroots&lt;br&gt;- Skyview Towers + Land &amp;amp; Sky Map Regions&lt;br&gt;- Stables&lt;br&gt;- Villages&lt;br&gt;- Bargainer Statues&lt;br&gt;- Great Fairys&lt;br&gt;- Dragon Tears&lt;br&gt;- Various POIs&lt;br&gt;- Zonai Device Dispensers&lt;br&gt;- Old Map Treasure &lt;i&gt;(Collect any Map &amp;amp; it shows all 31 Locations)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Notes:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Wise Old Man outside the Room of Awakening:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will be restricted from obtaining full (40) hearts until &lt;i&gt;AFTER&lt;/i&gt; you have the warp ability (Either via Rauru or 3 Warp Points option).&lt;br&gt;Timed Infinite Weapon Durability is restricted until &lt;i&gt;AFTER&lt;/i&gt; you take the leap from the first island which contains the RoA.&lt;br&gt;You will be unable to disable Fast Travel until after you have completed all 4 shrines on the GSI.&lt;br&gt;After the GSI is completed &lt;i&gt;(Sword sent back)&lt;/i&gt;, the Wise Old Man will travel to the top of Eventide Island.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phantom Mode:&lt;/b&gt; Since the method used makes the player unnoticeable, Zonai terminals/shrine doors won't automatically detect you and enable/light up when you are near &lt;i&gt;(You are still able to manually interact with them though)&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Master Sword Usable Recharge:&lt;/b&gt; Instead of the Master Sword being unusable when it's durability has been depleted, it becomes a weaker version (10 Damage) and is unfusable until it has fully recharged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Autocomplete GSI:&lt;/b&gt; Only available until you take the first leap from the island with the RoA. This gives all abilities &amp;amp; fulfils requirements for completing the GSI - Requires a Save-Load Cycle after completed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cooked Recipes set to 888 does not show stacked number in pouch (Although they are actually stacked).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;TKMM required for installing &amp;amp; only tested on TotK v1.2.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Should work on all update versions of the game)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a "romfs only" mod (No exefs, ips, pchtxt, subsdk etc.) which modifies the &lt;i&gt;NoCalcSkipUtility&lt;/i&gt; part of the Player brain and isn't compatible with any other mod that also edits this.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;This was originally created to fulfil requests or to add options which were useful during different playthroughs and I want to give a MASSIVE thanks to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;a class="MemberLink" href="https://gamebanana.com/members/4593678" data-id="member_4593678"&gt;cargocult&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;for all the help, guidance and contributions in making this mod and also to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;a class="MemberLink" href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2537238" data-id="member_2537238"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/upic/6655992836eca.png" alt="Real Princess Zelda uPic" class="Upic" aria-describedby="tippy-12"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the Ambient Healing Mod.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/add_custom_items.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/wise_old_man_cheat_npc_114c.zip" type="application/zip"/>
